{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13734","headline":"公子行 · 顾况","name":"公子行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻薄儿，面如玉，紫陌春风缠马足。\n双𩍐悬金缕鹘飞，长衫刺雪生犀束\n绿槐夹道阴初成，珊瑚几节敌流星。\n红肌拂拂酒光狞，当街背拉金吾行。\n朝游冬冬鼓声发，暮游冬冬鼓声绝。\n入门不肯自升堂，美人扶踏金阶月。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}